==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|upholdester}}, from {{der|en|enm|upholder|t=dealer in small goods}}, from {{m|enm|upholden|t=to repair, uphold}}. Equivalent to {{af|en|uphold|-ster}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ʌpˈhəʊlstəɹə/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[craftsman]] who [[upholster]]s [[furniture]].

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|upholsterer bee}}

